\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {The headline result.} Prefix-caching payoff against concurrency, per card. The two lines lie almost on top of each other across a 4.35--5.26$\times ${} hardware gap. No price assumption and no derived quantity enters this figure.\relax }}{8}{figure.caption.24}\protected@file@percent }
